{title: What is Love?}
{artist: Twice}
{capo: 1st fret}
{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]Maeilgat-i yeonghwa sog-eseona
Chaeg[Bm] sog-eseona deulama sog-eseo
Salang-eul [Em]neukkyeo
Um salang-eul [Cm]baewo
[G]Nae ilcheoleom jakku gaseum-i ttwieo
Dugeund[Bm]ugeungeolyeo seolleim-e bupul-eo [Em]olla
Um gung-ge[Cm]umhaeseo michil geosman gat-a
{end_of_verse}


